Code derived from calibre
-------------------------

A large part of src/LiuXin_alpha is derived from calibre
(https://calibre-ebook.com), Copyright (c) 2008-2026 Kovid Goyal and the
calibre contributors, licensed under the GNU General Public License version 3.

Derived modules are identified in one of two ways:

- a `__license__` / `__copyright__` pair retained from calibre, naming the
  original author (Kovid Goyal, John Schember, Marshall T. Vandegrift and
  others); or
- a leading comment "Derived from calibre" or "Contains code derived from
  calibre" naming the upstream file.

dev-docs/architectural_reviews/licence-provenance-2026-11-16.csv records the
origin of every file under src/ as assessed on that date.


