Not yet audited
---------------

The remaining bundled libraries under src/LiuXin_alpha/utils/libraries/, the
assets under src/LiuXin_alpha/resources/calibre/ (fonts, dictionaries, images
and templates), extensions_source.zip and the book files used as test
fixtures each carry their own terms. They have not been individually audited;
that work is tracked as G-L6 and G-L7 in
dev-docs/architectural_reviews/global-review-2026-11-16.md. Until it is done,
treat each such file as governed by its upstream licence.
